OL,3,GNEWSADublin airport rail link cost more
OL,4,Athan doubles
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe minimum estimated cost of building
OL,7,Fa transport project which will link
OL,8,FDublin city centre to its airport has
OL,9,Fmore than doubled in four years.
OL,11,FThe Metrolink plan is expected to come
OL,12,Finto operation by the early 2030s and
OL,13,Fcould cost between bB,14.4bn (#12.3bn)
OL,14,Fand bB,17.5bn (#15bn).
OL,16,FThe estimated price tag in 2022 was
OL,17,Fbetween bB,7.16bn (#6.14bn) and
OL,18,FbB,12.25bn (#10.50bn).
