OL,3,GNEWSADublin airport rail link cost more
OL,4,Athan doubles
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project aims to connect the north
OL,7,Fand south sides of the city and will be
OL,8,F19.4km in length with 16 stations
OL,9,Fmostly underground.
